    "detailed_description": "<h1>Updating the roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Deck now fully supported!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local Co-Op is live now! Join Us on Discord\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/f1f5489eaad278de7d0b03908b4b4f01.avif?t=1754361618\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/dad47762c4d6bb387e856ace90077bb5.avif?t=1754361618\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By using the unreal engine 5, your journey of conquest will be more than ordinary. You will fully experience and immerse yourself in the violent beauty of blood and fire.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/657cf6bfde2249622d3c20815a670137.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/657cf6bfde2249622d3c20815a670137.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/657cf6bfde2249622d3c20815a670137.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Face endless tidal waves of alien mutants head-on! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you'll face an unimaginable number of alien mutants that appear rapidly from all around your field of vision. You'll destroy more than 20,000 enemies per game and the endless mode for hardcore gamers who want to challenge themselves.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/cac96cdc44342128a446aa1a6d7edf47.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/cac96cdc44342128a446aa1a6d7edf47.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/cac96cdc44342128a446aa1a6d7edf47.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/7c7107bdb77fe7ae21ca66e060aed41e.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/7c7107bdb77fe7ae21ca66e060aed41e.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/7c7107bdb77fe7ae21ca66e060aed41e.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What doesn't kill you makes you stronger </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will use a handy weapon to carve a path of survival on the battlefield. But as the battle progresses you'll unlock more battlefield weaponry like the plasma disc, orbital cannon, and devastator. Equipped with these devastating heavy weapons, you'll be transformed into a mobile arsenal on the battlefield! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/57dd16349c38f38d5ebf6c64459fc759.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/57dd16349c38f38d5ebf6c64459fc759.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/57dd16349c38f38d5ebf6c64459fc759.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Just Shoot! Just Blast! Just give it all!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers dozens of different styles of weapons and battlefield support props, you will have more than hundreds of free matching options, so please give full play to your imagination and enjoy the fun of harvesting the battle! Another highlight of this game is that each weapon has its own special firing effect.The air waves from explosions and the dead ray from laser weapons give you varying degrees of satisfaction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/c0bd88a0fcd92a6a772b9308276333ec.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/c0bd88a0fcd92a6a772b9308276333ec.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/c0bd88a0fcd92a6a772b9308276333ec.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/a276af61b41bbcdc1797e17e8cdaa9de.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/a276af61b41bbcdc1797e17e8cdaa9de.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/a276af61b41bbcdc1797e17e8cdaa9de.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A friend in need is a friend indeed </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local cooperative mode is available. Embrace the chaos of true online and local cooperative.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/358a0f6a0273377d6e596fdf2554262d.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/358a0f6a0273377d6e596fdf2554262d.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/358a0f6a0273377d6e596fdf2554262d.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/08353cfe1ac43e15aee74f9b9b1efbc6.avif?t=1754361618\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/dad47762c4d6bb387e856ace90077bb5.avif?t=1754361618\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By using the unreal engine 5, your journey of conquest will be more than ordinary. You will fully experience and immerse yourself in the violent beauty of blood and fire.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/657cf6bfde2249622d3c20815a670137.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/657cf6bfde2249622d3c20815a670137.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/657cf6bfde2249622d3c20815a670137.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Face endless tidal waves of alien mutants head-on! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you'll face an unimaginable number of alien mutants that appear rapidly from all around your field of vision. You'll destroy more than 20,000 enemies per game and the endless mode for hardcore gamers who want to challenge themselves.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/cac96cdc44342128a446aa1a6d7edf47.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/cac96cdc44342128a446aa1a6d7edf47.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai