 offers dozens of different styles of weapons and battlefield support props, you will have more than hundreds of free matching options, so please give full play to your imagination and enjoy the fun of harvesting the battle! Another highlight of this game is that each weapon has its own special firing effect.The air waves from explosions and the dead ray from laser weapons give you varying degrees of satisfaction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/c0bd88a0fcd92a6a772b9308276333ec.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/c0bd88a0fcd92a6a772b9308276333ec.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/c0bd88a0fcd92a6a772b9308276333ec.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/a276af61b41bbcdc1797e17e8cdaa9de.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/a276af61b41bbcdc1797e17e8cdaa9de.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/a276af61b41bbcdc1797e17e8cdaa9de.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A friend in need is a friend indeed </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local cooperative mode is available. Embrace the chaos of true online and local cooperative.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/358a0f6a0273377d6e596fdf2554262d.poster.avif?t=1754361618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/358a0f6a0273377d6e596fdf2554262d.webm?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/358a0f6a0273377d6e596fdf2554262d.mp4?t=1754361618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218400/extras/08353cfe1ac43e15aee74f9b9b1efbc6.avif?t=1754361618\" /></div></p>",
